0..28 Comment "//! The nominal binding port"
29..102 Comment "//! [Pitts-2013-nominal_sets_names_symmetry_computer_science], ch. 4, and"
103..179 Comment "//! [Gabbay-2009-nominal_universal_algebra]. `bind (a : N) . T` abstracts an"
180..260 Comment "//! atom of the atom sort `N` over a port of sort `T`: swapping renames the atom"
261..329 Comment "//! and it may escape, where `pi+ (x : S) . T` binds a variable that"
330..408 Comment "//! substitution instantiates. Each block is a value of `Theory` that keeps an"
409..489 Comment "//! abstracting port as an `Abstracted` link of its operation\'s port chain, so a"
490..526 Comment "//! program reads it back by `case`."
527..530 Comment "//!"
531..601 Comment "//! - cites: [Pitts-2013-nominal_sets_names_symmetry_computer_science]"
602..654 Comment "//! - cites: [Gabbay-2009-nominal_universal_algebra]"
